      "heading": "Overview",
      "level": 1,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Consulate Docks Campaign Nightfall Region Istan Type Mission outpost Party size 8 Exit(s) Bejunkan PierConsulateLion's Gate Images On the world map A view inside",
        "The Consulate Docks is a private harbor and staging area for use by the Istani government for official purposes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Getting there",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "This outpost is first reached as part of the primary quest The Time is Nigh, after a cutscene in the Consulate. Once that quest has been completed, traveling to this location via the Consulate is no longer possible; you must use map travel.",
        "It is not uncommon to see players offering or looking for a \"ferry to the Docks\" in Kamadan. The ferry refers to a character with the Time is Nigh quest active. Since the quest will bring that character here, any other character in his or her party will also be brought here, regardless of their level or any other requirements. The reason most players do this is solely to get access to the maxed armor that can be crafted in this location, or to join a party doing the quests that allow travel to Tyria or Cantha (and get ferried again)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Exits",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Bejunkan Pier (via Mhenlo, only for Nightfall characters that have completed Plague in Cantha) Consulate (west) Lion's Gate (via Mhenlo, only for Nightfall characters that have completed Terror in Tyria)"
      ]
    },
