    {
      "heading": "Notes",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "This is one of very few outposts that does not have a merchant. Complete exploration of this outpost contributes less than 0.1% to the Elonian Cartographer title.",
        "Anomaly.The loading screen for this area is the loading screen for Kourna.",
        "Bug.A character may ferry other characters to this outpost way before they should have access to it, while normally when characters that have not fulfilled the requirements to enter would be left out of the party when other players enter it, as happens in Vizunah Square (Local Quarter) without first completing Zen Daijun.",
        "Towns and outposts in Istan Kamadan, Jewel of Istan • Beknur Harbor • Blacktide Den • Chahbek Village • Champion's Dawn • Consulate Docks • Jokanur Diggings • Kodlonu Hamlet • Sunspear Arena • Sunspear Great Hall • The Astralarium Missions • Arenas • Explorable areas • Landmarks"
      ]
