  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Consulate_Docks\" title=\"Consulate Docks\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Consulate_Docks_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Consulate Docks (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Consulate Docks\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Consulate_Docks.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Consulate Docks.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/05/Consulate_Docks.jpg/196px-Consulate_Docks.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/0/05/Consulate_Docks.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Istan\" title=\"Istan\">Istan</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Bejunkan_Pier\" title=\"Bejunkan Pier\">Bejunkan Pier</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Consulate\" title=\"Consulate\">Consulate</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Lion%27s_Gate\" title=\"Lion&#39;s Gate\">Lion's Gate</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Kamadan,_Jewel_of_Istan_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Kamadan, Jewel of Istan world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d3/Kamadan%2C_Jewel_of_Istan_world_map.jpg/196px-Kamadan%2C_Jewel_of_Istan_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d3/Kamadan%2C_Jewel_of_Istan_world_map.jpg/294px-Kamadan%2C_Jewel_of_Istan_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d3/Kamadan%2C_Jewel_of_Istan_world_map.jpg/392px-Kamadan%2C_Jewel_of_Istan_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"478\" data-file-height=\"239\" /></a><br /><small>On the world map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Consulate_Docks_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Consulate Docks inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/5b/Consulate_Docks_inside.jpg/196px-Consulate_Docks_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/5b/Consulate_Docks_inside.jpg/294px-Consulate_Docks_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/5b/Consulate_Docks_inside.jpg/392px-Consulate_Docks_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"750\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>Consulate Docks</b> is a private harbor and staging area for use by the <a href=\"/wiki/Istan\" title=\"Istan\">Istani</a> government for official purposes.\n</p>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>These docks, located behind the imposing <a href=\"/wiki/Consulate\" title=\"Consulate\">Consulate</a> building at the northern end of <a href=\"/wiki/Kamadan\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kamadan\">Kamadan</a>, are used solely for official government business. They can only be accessed though the Consulate, and then only with written approval. Elders traveling to the <a href=\"/wiki/Elona\" title=\"Elona\">Elonian</a> mainland, as well as ambassadors from <a href=\"/wiki/Kourna\" title=\"Kourna\">Kourna</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbi</a>, depart from here, bypassing the chaos of the common docks, which are used for trade vessels and tourists.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Quests_available\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests available</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Consulate_Docks_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This outpost is first reached as part of the <a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">primary quest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Time_is_Nigh\" title=\"The Time is Nigh\">The Time is Nigh</a>, after a cutscene in the Consulate. Once that quest has been completed, traveling to this location via the Consulate is no longer possible; you must use <a href=\"/wiki/Map_travel\" title=\"Map travel\">map travel</a>.\n</p><p>It is not uncommon to see players offering or looking for a \"<a href=\"/wiki/Ferry\" title=\"Ferry\">ferry</a> to the Docks\" in <a href=\"/wiki/Kamadan,_Jewel_of_Istan\" title=\"Kamadan, Jewel of Istan\">Kamadan</a>. The ferry refers to a <a href=\"/wiki/Character\" title=\"Character\">character</a> with the Time is Nigh quest active. Since the quest will bring that character here, any other character in his or her party will also be brought here, regardless of their level or any other requirements. The reason most players do this is solely to get access to the maxed armor that can be <a href=\"/wiki/Craft\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Craft\">crafted</a> in this location, or to join a party doing the quests that allow travel to Tyria or Cantha (and get ferried again).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Consulate_Docks_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bejunkan_Pier\" title=\"Bejunkan Pier\">Bejunkan Pier</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Mhenlo\" title=\"Mhenlo\">Mhenlo</a>, only for Nightfall characters that have completed <a href=\"/wiki/Plague_in_Cantha\" title=\"Plague in Cantha\">Plague in Cantha</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Consulate\" title=\"Consulate\">Consulate</a> (west)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lion%27s_Gate\" title=\"Lion&#39;s Gate\">Lion's Gate</a> (via Mhenlo, only for Nightfall characters that have completed <a href=\"/wiki/Terror_in_Tyria\" title=\"Terror in Tyria\">Terror in Tyria</a>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests_available\">Quests available</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Consulate_Docks_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Quests available\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dinja\" title=\"Dinja\">Dinja</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/All_for_One_and_One_for_Justice\" title=\"All for One and One for Justice\">All for One and One for Justice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chasing_Zenmai\" title=\"Chasing Zenmai\">Chasing Zenmai</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Consulate_Docks_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Consulate_Docks_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Consulate_Docks_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Vatundo\" title=\"Vatundo\">Vatundo</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Armorer\" title=\"Armorer\">armorer</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Agent\" title=\"Xunlai Agent\">Xunlai Agent</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage_upgrades\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage upgrades\">storage upgrades</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Chest\" title=\"Xunlai Chest\">Xunlai Chest</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage\">storage</a>)</li></ul>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Henchmen\">Henchmen</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Consulate_Docks_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Henchmen\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h5>\n<dl><dd><i>(all level 17)</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Devona\" title=\"Devona\">Devona</a> (Fighter)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Aidan\" title=\"Aidan\">Aidan</a> (Archer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Kihm\" title=\"Kihm\">Kihm</a> (Monk)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Eve\" title=\"Eve\">Eve</a> (Blood)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Odurra\" title=\"Odurra\">Odurra</a> (Domination)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cynn\" title=\"Cynn\">Cynn</a> (Fire)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Herta\" title=\"Herta\">Herta</a> (Earth)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sogolon\" title=\"Sogolon\">Sogolon</a> (Motivation)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Dervish\"><img alt=\"Dervish\" src=\"/images/3/3e/Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Gehraz\" title=\"Gehraz\">Gehraz</a> (Holy)</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_allies\">Other allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Consulate_Docks_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Other allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Mhenlo\" title=\"Mhenlo\">Mhenlo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Dinja\" title=\"Dinja\">Dinja</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Kohjo\" title=\"Kohjo\">Kohjo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Lahna\" title=\"Lahna\">Lahna</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Raidmarshal_Mehdara\" title=\"Raidmarshal Mehdara\">Raidmarshal Mehdara</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Mission_starter\" title=\"Mission starter\">mission starter</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Yamamank\" title=\"Yamamank\">Yamamank</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Mission_briefing\" title=\"Mission briefing\">mission briefing</a>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Consulate_Docks_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is one of very few <a href=\"/wiki/Outpost\" title=\"Outpost\">outposts</a> that does not have a <a href=\"/wiki/Merchant\" title=\"Merchant\">merchant</a>.</li>\n<li>Complete exploration of this outpost contributes less than 0.1% to the Elonian <a href=\"/wiki/Cartographer\" title=\"Cartographer\">Cartographer</a> title.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"margin: 1em; border: solid silver; border-width: 1px 0px; padding: 2px 1em 2px 7.5em;\"><strong class=\"hiddenlinks\" style=\"position: absolute; margin-left: -7.3em; color: #900;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Anomaly.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Anomaly\"><img alt=\"Anomaly\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/a6/Anomaly.png/18px-Anomaly.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a6/Anomaly.png/27px-Anomaly.png 1.5x, /images/a/a6/Anomaly.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Anomaly\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Anomaly\">Anomaly</a>.</strong>The loading screen for this area is the loading screen for Kourna.</div>\n<div style=\"margin: 1em; border: solid silver; border-width: 1px 0px; padding: 2px 1em 2px 5em;\"><strong class=\"hiddenlinks\" style=\"position: absolute; margin-left: -4.8em; color: #900;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bug.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Bug\"><img alt=\"Bug\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/7d/Bug.png/18px-Bug.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/7d/Bug.png/27px-Bug.png 1.5x, /images/7/7d/Bug.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Bug\" title=\"Bug\">Bug</a>.</strong>A character may <a href=\"/wiki/Ferry\" title=\"Ferry\">ferry</a> other characters to this outpost way before they should have access to it, while normally when characters that have not fulfilled the requirements to enter would be left out of the party when other players enter it, as happens in <a href=\"/wiki/Vizunah_Square_(Local_Quarter)\" title=\"Vizunah Square (Local Quarter)\">Vizunah Square (Local Quarter)</a> without first completing <a href=\"/wiki/Zen_Daijun\" title=\"Zen Daijun\">Zen Daijun</a>.</div>\n<hr style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; clear:both;\" />\n<table style=\"border:1px solid silver; font-size:90%; width:90%; text-align:center; clear:both;\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#BAE; font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Istan#Towns_and_outposts\" title=\"Istan\">Towns and outposts in Istan</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kamadan,_Jewel_of_Istan\" title=\"Kamadan, Jewel of Istan\">Kamadan, Jewel of Istan</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Beknur_Harbor\" title=\"Beknur Harbor\">Beknur Harbor</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blacktide_Den_(outpost)\" title=\"Blacktide Den (outpost)\">Blacktide Den</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chahbek_Village_(outpost)\" title=\"Chahbek Village (outpost)\">Chahbek Village</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Champion%27s_Dawn\" title=\"Champion&#39;s Dawn\">Champion's Dawn</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Consulate Docks</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jokanur_Diggings_(outpost)\" title=\"Jokanur Diggings (outpost)\">Jokanur Diggings</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kodlonu_Hamlet\" title=\"Kodlonu Hamlet\">Kodlonu Hamlet</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sunspear_Arena_(outpost)\" title=\"Sunspear Arena (outpost)\">Sunspear Arena</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">